sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant E as Product event
    participant J as Durable job
    participant R as AI runtime
    participant M as Model route
    participant T as Governed tools
    participant P as Product contexts

    E->>J: enqueue once with causal identity
    J->>R: actor/community scope + trigger
    R->>R: assemble context and capability catalog
    loop Working rounds under deadline
        R->>M: messages + admitted tools
        M-->>R: assistant content or tool calls
        R->>T: validate and dispatch with trusted scope
        T-->>R: result, citation, artifact, or honest failure
    end
    R->>M: terminal composition / bounded repair
    M-->>R: attributed user-facing draft
    R->>R: validate output and evidence identities
    R->>P: persist reply, citations, artifacts, and lifecycle
    P-->>J: durable completion or explicit failure
